<div id="top"></div><section class="page-banner container"><p class="section-label">ALL THE STORIES / 所有故事</p><h1 id="archive-heading"><% if (is_category()) { %><%= page.category %><% } else if (is_tag()) { %><%= page.tag %><% } else { %>文章归档<% } %><span class="heading-mark">.</span></h1><p>沿着时间的线索，找回每一段思考与记录。</p></section>
<section class="archive-section container"><% if (page.posts.length) { %><div class="archive-list"><% page.posts.each(function(post, index) { %><article class="archive-item"><span class="archive-number"><%= String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0') %></span><div><span class="archive-date"><%= date(post.date, 'YYYY.MM.DD') %></span><h2><a href="<%- url_for(post.path) %>"><%= post.title %></a></h2><p><%= post.description || strip_html(post.excerpt || post.content).replace(/\s+/g, ' ').slice(0, 110) %></p></div><a class="archive-arrow" href="<%- url_for(post.path) %>" aria-label="阅读<%= post.title %>">↗</a></article><% }) %></div><% if (page.total > 1) { %><nav class="pagination" aria-label="文章分页"><%- paginator({prev_text: '← 上一页', next_text: '下一页 →'}) %></nav><% } %><% } else { %><p class="empty-state">这里暂时没有文章。</p><% } %></section>
